# ユーザ環境設定's tags pulled out (docs/tessronos 10.6, 11.6), as ui_sysenv_tagpull.steps does for
# システム環境設定: 〈音属性〉 pressed and moved past LK_DRAG_W is carried into BTRON, where the object
# ユーザ環境設定：音属性 is made and a link to it put, as このページの仮身を作る makes one; the sheet shown stays 〈キー属性〉, and the link opened shows
# 〈音属性〉 in the same window. For tools/ui_run.py with the kernel of make TARGET=_QEMU_VIRT_ DESKTOP=1
# UITEST=1 and the test disk of a KTEST=1 build. The window is at 180,90; BTRON shows at 100,200.
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b7-7c63-8e83-4f9a012c3d53 {"tessronos-userenv":{"data":"key"}}
expect userenv: page "key"
wait 1200
win ユーザ環境設定
want ok 180 90 772 652
move 900 700
wait 300
shot up_before
logmark
move 520 134
down
move 526 136
expectsince tvpage: tag 5 pulled out, page "sound", outline
move 300 170
wait 300
move 100 200
wait 500
up
expectsince userenv: link of page "sound" carried (0)
expectsince tvpage: object "ユーザ環境設定：音属性" of page "sound" made (0)
expectsince tvpage: link of page "sound" carried, named "ユーザ環境設定：音属性" (0)
expectsince cabinet: dropped 1
wait 800
shot up_put
# the link put shows the name of the page's object, ユーザ環境設定：音属性, in its band (the letters
# right of the pointer, recorded from a run that put it)
shotsum up_put 126 191 256 205
want ok 578627089f302b2a
shotsame up_before up_put 200 230 760 630
logmark
dclick 100 200
expectsince userenv: page "sound"
wait 500
nwin ユーザ環境設定
want ok 1
absent !OACV!
